        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "按 + standard or basis",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "按 introduces the standard, basis or order followed by an action. It is not the physical verb press in this construction.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "请按要求做。",
                "pinyin": "qǐng àn yāoqiú zuò 。",
                "meaning": "Please do it as required.",
                "audio": "e44cbc87e77af4414ece23bca9a6e8d36085be62e41d987a0c5b8920ad12c4f5"
              },
              {
                "text": "我们按时间顺序看。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen àn shíjiān shùnxù kàn 。",
                "meaning": "We look at them in chronological order.",
                "audio": "496e7b665ee604d06f1357ab00b9d110b1948cb4f461b00e5bc0b37e6803171f"
              }
